{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18032","headline":"感春五首 四 · 韩愈","name":"感春五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前随杜尹拜表廻，笑言溢口何欢咍。\n孔丞别我适临汝，风骨峭峻遗尘埃。\n音容不接祗隔夜，凶讣讵可相寻来。\n天公高居鬼神恶，欲保性命诚难哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}